{"pageid": 332, "title": "Archer's Peak", "revid": 2688, "categories": ["Locations", "Archer's Peak"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Archer&#39;s Peak</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/35/ArchersPeakBusStop.png/revision/latest?cb=20241223124231\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"ArchersPeakBusStop\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/35/ArchersPeakBusStop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241223124231\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/35/ArchersPeakBusStop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241223124231 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/something-is-killing-the-children/images/3/35/ArchersPeakBusStop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/534?cb=20241223124231 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"ArchersPeakBusStop\" width=\"270\" height=\"104\" data-image-key=\"ArchersPeakBusStop.png\" data-image-name=\"ArchersPeakBusStop.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Wisconsin, USA</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Archer's Peak</b> is a small town in Wisconsin. Due to the manifestations of <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a>, the town was plagued by <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Monster\" title=\"Monster\">monsters</a> for several weeks, forcing the <a href=\"/wiki/Order_of_St._George\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Order of St. George\">Order of St. George</a> to intervene. \n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span></h2>\n<p>Archer's Peak was considered a normal, small town for a long while, with few incidents happening other than hunting accidents.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC4&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC4-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> However, in 2020, after young resident <a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a> made up a story of a monster to scare his friends, the story spread<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC12&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC12-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> and the collective fear summoned an <a href=\"/wiki/Oscuratypes\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Oscuratypes\">Oscuratype</a> <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfbW90aGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">creature</span> that began to kill the local children. It would eventually start collecting bodies to bring to its den, where it would then give birth to <span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype children (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQXJjaGVyJTI3c19QZWFrX09zY3VyYXR5cGVfY2hpbGRyZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">five children</span>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SIKTC5&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SIKTC5-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Locations\">Locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Applebeams</li>\n<li>Archer's Peak High School</li>\n<li>Archer's Peak Police Department</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Residents\">Residents</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Current\">Current</span></h3>\n<table class=\"fdbullet\" style=\"background-color:transparent; color:inherit; width:100%; vertical-align:top;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ben\" title=\"Ben\">Ben</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dan_Brisby\" title=\"Dan Brisby\">Dan Brisby</a></li>\n<li>Cavanaugh Family\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Joe_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Joe Cavanaugh\">Sheriff Joe Cavanaugh</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tim_Cavanaugh\" title=\"Tim Cavanaugh\">Tim Cavanaugh</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/John_Collins\" title=\"John Collins\">John Collins</a></li>\n<li>Gail's Family\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Bian\" title=\"Bian\">Bian</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"David (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRGF2aWQ/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">David</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Gail\" title=\"Gail\">Gail</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Henry\" title=\"Henry\">Henry</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\">\n<ul><li>James's Family\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/James\" title=\"James\">James</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/James%27s_father\" title=\"James&#39;s father\">James's father</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"James&#39;s sister (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSmFtZXMlMjdzX3Npc3Rlcj9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">James's sister</span></li></ul></li>\n<li>Mahoney Family\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mr._Mahoney\" title=\"Mr. Mahoney\">Mr. Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Ms._Mahoney\" title=\"Ms. Mahoney\">Ms. Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tommy_Mahoney\" title=\"Tommy Mahoney\">Tommy Mahoney</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Carly_Monitz\" title=\"Carly Monitz\">Carly Monitz</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Parker_Parents\" title=\"Parker Parents\">Mr. Parker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Parker_Parents\" title=\"Parker Parents\">Ms. Parker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tam\" title=\"Tam\">Tam</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Victoria\" title=\"Victoria\">Victoria</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Deceased\">Deceased</span></h3>\n<table class=\"fdbullet\" style=\"background-color:transparent; color:inherit; width:100%; vertical-align:top;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Alyssa_Dean\" title=\"Alyssa Dean\">Alyssa Dean</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Bian&#39;s Sister (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmlhbiUyN3NfU2lzdGVyP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Bian's Sister</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Karl\" title=\"Karl\">Karl</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sophie_Mahoney\" title=\"Sophie Mahoney\">Sophie Mahoney</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Tyler_Monitz\" title=\"Tyler Monitz\">Tyler Monitz</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Noah\" title=\"Noah\">Noah</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\">\n<ul><li>Parker Family\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Brendan_Parker\" title=\"Brendan Parker\">Brendan Parker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Corey_Parker\" title=\"Corey Parker\">Corey Parker</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Jason_Parker\" title=\"Jason Parker\">Jason Parker</a></li>\n<li>Unnamed Fourth Child</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/John_Richards\" title=\"John Richards\">Officer John Richards</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Robbie\" title=\"Robbie\">Robbie</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sally\" title=\"Sally\">Sally</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sara_Washington\" title=\"Sara Washington\">Sara Washington</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Monsters\">Monsters</span></h3>\n<ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Archer&#39;s Peak Oscuratype mother (page does not exist)\" da